            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q: How much does it cost to use a study abroad consultant in Nepal?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c91aac9eeed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ea18e979b81d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nFees vary depending on the destination country and the range of services. Generally, reputable consultants charge anywhere from NPR 10,000 to NPR 50,000 or more. Always ask for a detailed fee structure upfront."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
