      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "01e229305b15",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Q: Can I apply to universities abroad without a consultant?"
        },
        {
          "_key": "afea135f5383",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "90af9fb108fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nTechnically, yes. However, the process involves a lot of paperwork, deadlines, and country-specific requirements. A trusted consultant significantly reduces the risk of errors and increases your chances of success."
